  "description": "API probe P22-B, layer stack (phase1.24 item 3.4, decision 296): on the plane, a fill layer and a group above it; in the first session and after save/reopen, Node.set_blending_mode with every documented layerstack.BlendingMode member on the fill's BaseColor channel, each followed by Node.get_blending_mode; the three NormalMap* members and Normal on its Normal channel; PassThrough and Normal on the group's BaseColor. Exercises the BlendingMode members Color, ColorBurn, ColorDodge, Darken, Difference, Disable, Divide, Exclusion, HardLight, InverseDivide, InverseSubtract, Lighten, LinearBurn, LinearLight, NormalMapCombine, NormalMapInverseDetail, Overlay, PassThrough, PinLight, Replace, Saturation, SignedAddition, SoftLight, Subtract, Tint, Value and VividLight (and Normal, Multiply, LinearDodge, Screen and NormalMapDetail again).",
